# Definition of Done (Contract §4)

A plan set is incomplete if any box is missing. Demo these, do not only unit-test them.

- [ ] Patient completes **MSK and non-MSK** triage end-to-end, in **English, Pidgin, Yoruba, Igbo, Hausa**, with **specialty-based** matching (never default a non-MSK case to the nearest MSK generalist)
- [ ] Red-flag detection fires immediately, independent of the LLM, **reasoning shown to the patient**
- [ ] Booking status only advances on confirmed **Paystack webhook** events
- [ ] Physio onboarding, availability, booking alerts, session notes, payouts — **all via WhatsApp**
- [ ] Family add / permission / revoke and physio-relay questions work via WhatsApp
- [ ] Partner referral tracking and fee confirmation fire via webhook/WhatsApp
- [ ] Every triage / match / payout decision is in the append-only audit log, independently queryable
- [ ] Context persists across sessions and personas — nothing already on record is re-asked
